<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light"><meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
<title>Marcus Hale invited you to the Hale Family tree</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background-color:#F6F4EC;">
<span style="display:none;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;max-height:0;max-width:0;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;color:#F6F4EC;">Accept your invitation to the family tree. The link works for 7 days.</span>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#F6F4EC" style="width:100%;background-color:#F6F4EC;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;background-color:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #D9E0DB;border-radius:12px;">
<tr><td bgcolor="#1E4D4A" style="padding:18px 28px;background-color:#1E4D4A;border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;">
<img src="https://tree.hale.example/email/logo.png" width="81" height="30" alt="KinShip" style="display:block;width:81px;height:30px;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;">
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:28px 28px 10px 28px;">
<h1 style="margin:0 0 14px 0;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:25px;line-height:31px;font-weight:600;color:#17231F;">You’re invited to the Hale Family tree</h1><p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#17231F;">Marcus Hale has invited you to join the Hale Family tree on KinShip, a private place where your family keeps its people, photos, stories and history together.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" style="width:100%;margin:0 0 18px 0;border:1px solid #D9E0DB;border-radius:10px;background-color:#FFFFFF;"><tr><td width="56" valign="top" style="width:56px;padding:14px 0 14px 14px;"><table role="presentation" width="40" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" bgcolor="#E0EDE1" style="width:40px;border-radius:20px;background-color:#E0EDE1;"><tr><td width="40" height="40" align="center" valign="middle" style="width:40px;height:40px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',Times,serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:40px;color:#1E4D4A;">SH</td></tr></table></td><td valign="top" style="padding:14px 16px 14px 10px;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><p style="margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;font-weight:600;color:#17231F;">Your account is linked to Sofia Hale</p><p style="margin:2px 0 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#5B6A65;">You will see yourself on the tree.</p></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#17231F;">Your role is Family Admin. You can edit the whole tree, and invite and look after the people who use it.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:6px 0 18px 0;"><tr><td bgcolor="#1E4D4A" style="border-radius:8px;background-color:#1E4D4A;"><a href="https://tree.hale.example/invite/SAMPLE-not-a-real-link" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Accept invitation</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;color:#5B6A65;word-break:break-word;">This link works once and expires in 7 days. If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser: https://tree.hale.example/invite/SAMPLE-not-a-real-link</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;margin:4px 0 0 0;border-top:1px solid #D9E0DB;"><tr><td style="padding:16px 0 0 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;"><p style="margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:20px;font-weight:600;color:#17231F;">A few things worth knowing</p><ul style="margin:0;padding:0 0 0 18px;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;color:#17231F;"><li style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">Your health information is private. Nobody sees it unless you share it with them, one person at a time.</li><li style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">DNA results you add are visible to family accounts. Your match lists and raw files stay with you.</li><li style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">You choose which reminders you get in My settings.</li></ul></td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
<table role="presentation" width="560" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:16px 8px 0 8px;">
<p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5B6A65;text-align:center;">Sent by the Hale Family tree on KinShip (https://tree.hale.example).</p><p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#5B6A65;text-align:center;">If you were not expecting this, ignore this email. Nothing happens until you accept.</p>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</body></html>